    "about": [
      "A song cycle on poetry by Yannis Ritsos, with Grigoris Bithikotsis singing. According to the composer's catalogue it was first presented in Athens on 25 February 1966.",
      "The record has nine songs and opens with “Afta ta dentra”. Theodorakis's relationship with Ritsos's poetry, from Epitaphios to Romiosini, is one of the best-known in twentieth-century Greek music."
